rk.1:40-42 Luk.4:27 5:12-13 7:22 17:14, 17; ἡ λέπρα ἐκαθερίσθη (on the spelling see supr.), Mat.8:3. \n __2. In ethical sense: τ. καρδίας, Act.15:9 (cf. Sir.38:10); τ. χεῖρας, Jas.4:8; λαὸν ἑαυτῷ, Tit.2:14; τ. ἐκκλησίαν, Eph.5:26; with accusative of person(s) (of thing(s)), before ἀπό (131., § 36, 9; Deiss., BS, 216 f.), 2Co.7:1, Heb.9:14, 1Jn.1:7 Jn 1:9. \n __3. In ceremonial sense: Mrk.7:19, Act.10:15 11:9, Heb.9:22-23 10:2 (cf. δια-καθαρίζω).†\n (AS)","source_line":2692}],"occurrence_count":31,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"limpo","count":4},{"gloss":"limpos","count":3},{"gloss":"purificar","count":3},{"gloss":"limpar","count":2},{"gloss":"limpais","count":2},{"gloss":"purificados","count":2},{"gloss":"purificou","count":2},{"gloss":"expulsai","count":1},{"gloss":"limpa","count":1},{"gloss":"ficou-limpo","count":1},{"gloss":"limpas","count":1},{"gloss":"foi-purificado","count":1},{"gloss":"purificando","count":1},{"gloss":"limpemo","count":1},{"gloss":"havendo-purificado","count":1},{"gloss":"purificará","count":1},{"gloss":"purificadas","count":1},{"gloss":"sacrifícios","count":1},{"gloss":"limpai","count":1},{"gloss":"purifica","count":1}]},"G275":{"id":"G275","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G0275","disambiguated_id":"G0275 =","unique_id":"G0275","headword":"ἀμέριμνος","transliteration":"amerimnos","lexical_morphology":"G:A","gloss_en":"untroubled","definition_en":"ἀμέριμνος, -ον\n (μέριμνα), [in LXX: Wis.6:15 7:23 * ;] \nfree from anxiety or care: Mat.28:14, 1Co.7:32 (for exx., see MM, VGT, see word).†\n (AS)","source_line":378}],"occurrence_count":2,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"sem-preocupação","count":2}]},"G2842":{"id":"G2842","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G2842","disambiguated_id":"G2842 =","unique_id":"G2842","headword":"κοινωνία","transliteration":"koinōnia","lexical_morphology":"G:N-F","gloss_en":"participation","definition_en":"κοινωνία, -ας, ἡ\n (κοινωνός), [in LXX: Lev.6:2 (יָד תְּשׂוּמֶת), Wis.8:18, 3Ma.4:6 * ;] \n__1. fellowship, communion: Act.2:42, 2Co.6:14, Php.1:5; τ. υἱοῦ, 1Co.1:9; τ. αἵματος, σώματος Χρ., 1Co.10:10 : παθημάτων αὐτσῦ, Php.3:10; τ. πνεύματος, 2Co.13:13, Php.2:1; δεξιὰς κοινωνίας, Gal.2:9; τ. πίστεώς σου, Phm 6; before μετὰ: τ. πατρός, 1Jn.1:3 Jn 1:6; ἡμῶν, ἀλλήλων, 1Jn.1:3 Jn 1:7. \n __2. contribution (as outcome of fellowship): Rom.15:26, 2Co.8:4 9:13, Heb.13:6 (cf. Art. Communion, DB, i, 460 ff.; MM, Exp., xv).†\n (AS)","source_line":3036}],"occurrence_count":19,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"comunhão","count":15},{"gloss":"pareceu-bem","count":1},{"gloss":"parceria","count":1},{"gloss":"cooperação","count":1},{"gloss":"bem","count":1}]},"G3135":{"id":"G3135","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G3135","disambiguated_id":"G3135 =","unique_id":"G3135","headword":"μαργαρίτης","transliteration":"margaritēs","lexical_morphology":"G:N-M","gloss_en":"pearl","definition_en":"μαργαρίτης, -ου, ὁ \n a pearl: Mat.13:45-46, 1Ti.2:9, Rev.17:4 18:12, 16 21:21 (-ῖται, WH); proverbially, Mat.7:6.†\n (AS)","source_line":3339}],"occurrence_count":9,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"pérolas","count":7},{"gloss":"pérola","count":2}]},"G3451":{"id":"G3451","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G3451","disambiguated_id":"G3451 =","unique_id":"G3451","headword":"μουσικός","transliteration":"mousikos","lexical_morphology":"G:A","gloss_en":"musician","definition_en":"μουσικός, -ή, -όν \n [in LXX: Gen.31:27, Eze.26:13 (שִׁיר), Dan LXX TH Dan.3:5 ff. (זְמָר), Sir.22:6, al. ;] \nskilled in the arts, esp. in music; as subst., ὁ μ., a minstrel, musician: Rev.18:22.†\n (AS)","source_line":3564}],"occurrence_count":1,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"músicos","count":1}]},"G3778":{"id":"G3778","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G3778","disambiguated_id":"G3778 =","unique_id":"G3778","headword":"οὗτος","transliteration":"ohutos","lexical_morphology":"G:D","gloss_en":"this/he/she/it","definition_en":"οὗτος, αὕτη, τοῦτο, genitive, τούτου, ταύτης, τούτου, \n [in LXX chiefly for זֹאת ,זֶה ;] \n demonstr. pron. (related to ἐκεῖνος as hic to ille), \nthis; \n__1. as subst., this one, he; \n__(a) absol.: Mat.3:17, Mrk.9:7, Luk.7:44, 45, Jhn.1:15, Act.2:15, al.; expressing contempt (cl.), Mat.13:55, 56, Mrk.6:2, 3, Jhn.6:42, al.; εἰς τοῦτο, Mrk.1:38, Rom.14:9; μετὰ τοῦτο (ταῦτα; V. Westc. on Jhn.5:1), Jhn.2:12 11:7, al.; \n __(b) epanaleptic (referring to what precedes): Mat.5:19, Mrk.3:35, Luk.9:48, Jhn.6:46, Rom.7:10, al.; \n __(with) proleptic (referring to what follows): before ἵνα (Bl., §69, 6), Luk.1:43, Jhn.3:19 (and freq.) 15:8, Rom.14:9, al.; before ὅτι, Luk.10:11, Jhn.9:3o, Act.24:14, Rom.2:3, al.; ὅπως, Rom.9:17; ἐάν, Jhn.13:35; \n __(d) special idioms: τοῦτο μὲν . . . τ. δέ (cl), partly . . . partly. Heb.10:33; καὶ τοῦτο (τοῦτον, ταῦτα), and that (him) too, Rom.13:11, 1Co.2:2, Heb.11:12; τοῦτ᾽ ἐστιν, Mat.27:46.\n __2. As adj., with subst.; \n__(a) with art. \n__(α) before the art.: Mat.12:32, Mrk.9:29, Luk.7:44, Jhn.4:15, Rom.11:24, Rev.19:9, al.; \n __(β) after the noun: Mat.3:9, Mrk.12:16, Luk.11:31, Jhn.4:13, Act.6:13, Rom.15:28, 1Co.1:20, Rev.2:24, al.; \n __(b) with subst. anarth. (with predicative force; Bl., §49, 4): Luk.1:36 2:2 24:21, Jhn.2:11 4:54 21:14, 2Co.13:1.\n (AS)","source_line":3896}],"occurrence_count":1385,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"este","count":350},{"gloss":"isto","count":277},{"gloss":"estas","count":236},{"gloss":"esta","count":142},{"gloss":"isso","count":102},{"gloss":"estes","count":93},{"gloss":"destes","count":37},{"gloss":"nisto","count":36},{"gloss":"deste","count":33},{"gloss":"nesta","count":22},{"gloss":"desta","count":22},{"gloss":"estas-coisas","count":18},{"gloss":"destas-coisas","count":3},{"gloss":"a-estes","count":3},{"gloss":"ESTE","count":2},{"gloss":"ela","count":1},{"gloss":"a-este","count":1},{"gloss":"aquilo","count":1},{"gloss":"mesmo","count":1},{"gloss":"essas-coisas","count":1},{"gloss":"por-esta","count":1},{"gloss":"nestas","co